{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've got one job: combine as many balls as you can inside the confines of the container.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack too high or spill some over the edge and it's all over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching two balls of the same type will convert them into one ball of the next tier; the higher the tier, the more points you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you can get a ball of the highest tier? .....What about <i><strong>two</strong></i> of them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3 Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sports</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing the <i>Ball Launcher</i>. Hold down the 'drop' button to charge up power and send the balls soarin'. (Beware of bouncing balls to the stratosphere...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with Ping Pong Balls flying everywhere and end with Beach Balls getting pummeled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balls have individualized weights, so be careful! An 8-Ball has a bit more <i>oomph</i> to it than a larger Tennis Ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bubble Ball! in Spaaace!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things will be floaty in this Low Gravity environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to get <i>Mad</i> while combining planets until you create the <i>Sun</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bubbles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the sea, not all bubbles are your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the adorable sea creatures are!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juuust be careful of those pesky bubble hazards pushing your stuff around...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match your favorite settings:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balls  - Sports, Planets, or Bubbles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weight  - Uniform or\u00a0Individualized</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ball Dropper  - Normal or Launcher </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity - Normal or Low</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hazard - None or Bubbles</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"High Roller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2684230/ad0caaa7ca77a97b04b5aa1357ddee2e4a93d187.jpg"},{"name":"Athlete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2684230/9b0ea49753df4ec02b4e7b850e7b2d719afd3a7e.jpg"},{"name":"Astronaut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2684230/80ac4e1850bb08f8fe14283544dc6b7d87e923a1.jpg"},{"name":"Deep Diver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2684230/ea612f9f00df2e9e15255cec95ad36e82e8f3e94.jpg"},{"name":"Analyst","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2684230/28ce2ae6a5d8540408251ead4ae358d9c10795ec.jpg"},{"name":"\"I Hate Sand\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2684230/c5d6f8b103526fab1728dbe1e0113c0427eba9a0.jpg"},{"name":"Icarus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2684230/0dbda8d688a236cc79639cd3deb8e575e8da09ce.jpg"},{"name":"I Wanna Be Where The Bubbles Are","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2684230/4ad5bab0d6c4394df63ccda77f62b8ec470b5751.jpg"},{"name":"A Crowbo's Art","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2684230/05efbe40f38723397c323d680b87fe29384806b7.jpg"},{"name":"Sergeant Gunther Is Proud Of Yo